{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116479","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116479/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116479/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116479/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116479","id":3963248112,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7sOl3w","number":116479,"title":"Multi-codepoint emoji rendering regression on Linux","user":{"login":"vilhalmer","id":201439,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTQzOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201439?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer","html_url":"https://github.com/vilhalmer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-02-19T14:23:20Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T14:40:08Z","closed_at":"2026-02-19T14:39:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6-dev4, 4.6-stable, 4.6.1-stable\n- Not reproducible in: 4.5.1-stable, 4.5.2-rc1, 4.6-dev3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sun, 11 Jan 2026 17:10:53 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 11 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (RPL-P) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1340P (16 threads) - 29.08 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot 4.6 no longer renders some multiple-codepoint/surrogate pair emoji as a single character on Linux. Windows still works correctly, I don't have other platforms available to test. I narrowed the issue to being introduced between 4.6-dev3 and dev4. It occurs using either the X11 or Wayland display server. Not all emoji consisting of multiple codepoints are broken, for example 🏳️‍🌈 still works while 2️⃣ is broken.\n\nWhat's expected:\n\n<img width=\"1124\" height=\"714\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a6215a31-26b3-4800-a158-a51e30bb0dcb\" />\n\nWhat happens:\n\n<img width=\"1163\" height=\"735\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b44b8a77-f596-4117-8e79-dd4a9d9e31ef\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Select an appropriate emoji font for the project theme, I am using Noto Emoji.\n- Create a TextEdit or LineEdit and give it 2️⃣ as text.\n\nThe problem is visible in both the editor and the running project.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[godot-4.6-emoji-regression.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25417679/godot-4.6-emoji-regression.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"vilhalmer","id":201439,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTQzOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201439?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer","html_url":"https://github.com/vilhalmer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vilhalmer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116479/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116479/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}